  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.6 — New features\n• AddSinkSharpRequestId()   — stamps RequestId from HttpContext.TraceIdentifier\n• AddSinkSharpUserContext() — stamps UserId, UserName, UserRole (authenticated requests only)\n• AddSinkSharpRequestPath() — stamps HttpMethod + RequestPath\n• AddSinkSharpElapsedTime() — stamps ElapsedMs since request start (requires app.UseSinkSharp())\n• All four require builder.Services.AddHttpContextAccessor()\nv1.0.5 — New features\n• WriteTo(sink, minLevel) — per-sink minimum level\n• WithMachineName() — standalone MachineName enricher\n• .Filter(predicate) — drop events before enqueue, zero allocation\n• .WithEnricher(enricher, when: predicate) — conditional enrichment\n• SetGlobalLevel() / GetGlobalLevel() — runtime level change without restart\n• app.UseSinkSharp() — X-Correlation-Id middleware + ElapsedTime stopwatch\nv1.0.4 — Bug fixes: DisposeAsync idempotent, phone PII regex corrected\nv1.0.1 — Bug fix: email PII regex corrected\nv1.0.0 — Initial release: async channel queue, MEL ILogger, PII masking, correlation ID\nSee full changelog: https://github.com/SinkSharp/CHANGELOG.md",
